  "question": "Which gallery is closest when progressing from Gary Lapelusa Landscaping LLC, Bayonne, NJ toward Sloth Encounters, Hauppauge, NY?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.122011 40.662412)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.210029 40.824517)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.122011 40.662412)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.122011 40.662412)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
